    "question_text": "Bestiality ） (a) Recognition of zoos Mischief ) (b) IPC 274 and 275 (C) IPC 428 and 429 Brambell Committee The PCA Act Late Smt. Rukmini Devi Arundale Sale of adulterated/ noxious medicine (e) Founder Chairman AWBI CZA () Animal Welfare Oath (g) Summon",
