    "marks": 5,
    "question_text": "CITES means : 1 Krait is a non-poisonous snake. Conservation encompasses preservation of wild animals and their habitat. The feeding schedule for captive animals is formulated based on the extrapolating nutrient requirements from domesticated animal model. ( Benzodiazepines alone can be used for standing sedation in wild mammals.",
