    "question_text": "Write an essay on testicular degeneration in bull. (a) Superfoetation and superfecundation Superovulation and embryo transfer Fertility,tility antril Clinical uses of prostaglandins Methods of semen collection. o Sexual behaviour in males the Semen metabolism. detail Ectopic pregnancy 21 Mummification in in cattle.. Describe' # # 60 5 9 7 8 9",
