    "topic": "Leptospirosis Diagnosis - MAT (VPM Repeated)",
    "marks": 5,
    "question_text": "Osteomyelitis of jaw bone caused by (a) Actinomyces bovis (b) Actinobacillus ligneresi (e) Pasteurella multocida (d) None",
