    "question_text": "Surgery to arrive at diagnosis # (e) Exploratory surgery (b) Clinical surgery (c) Plastic surgery (d) Cosmetic surgery Tamponade plugging can be employed to control bleeding from Cavities (b) Surface wounds Nostrils (d) Mouth",
